ombos and their explosive effects!\n\n{585450227365264}\nInteract with your cockpit and unleash your EPIC ULTIMATE SKILL for total domination!\n\n\n\n", "short_description": "Join the Mecha Discord server now! https://discord.gg/VuNyZQQZKH\n\"Mecha Force\" is a VR mecha action game. Pilot the gigantic KYLIN in a chaotic future and face the Dominators, the ultimate threat to humanity. The fate of the world depends on your skills as a mecha pilot!\n\nMaki will serve as your navigator, control the steel giant KYLIN and fight to reclaim the future of humanity."}]}, "developer_name": "Ming Studio", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://mydearestvr.com/en/privacypolicy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Ming Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://mecha-force.com/en/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "821934236779161"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "3744040075834813"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["ACTION"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "ja", "zh_CN"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "35319458624364333"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031619_890152282876510_3210027318426485043_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=q1Q9279e-7wQ7kNvwFGt6-M&_nc_oc=Adpu1h2gS5j6ntlzpPPALwn4C1B_43Enwf1Wt0Azg12YAAMG_3bnChUM03zCj1pBCxo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh